---
description: Web and mobile talk to the API only through @pairkit/core
globs: "{web,mobile}/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Clients

- Call the API through `@pairkit/core`, `@pairkit/core/api`, or `@pairkit/core/client`.
- Do not import `backend`, the other client, or deep paths inside `core-modules`.
- Web supplies KV and session persistence around `createPairkitClient`. Mobile does the same with SecureStore. Do not fork the sync protocol in either app.
